==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>.
*1 [[Dagshund]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[Dagshund]] spawns after 24 seconds<sup>720f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Because of the [[Restriction Stage|restriction]] allowing only 2 cats to be spawned at once, no meatshields should be used. Instead, bring 2 powerful attackers, such as [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] or [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman]], then replace them when they die. At worst, you will have to use the base as damage sponge while you deal with the last enemies.

